Bind Npc 14301 Zone 21
Quest 93 "Silan's bone"
    Journal "If you bring 2 Apples of Moradon to [Blacksmith Hepa], you can receive 8000 EXP."
    Collect 2 of 810418000

Requires player level >= 17

Rewards
    Give 20000 experience

On available
    Say "Master, I hear Blacksmith Heppa needs for Apples of Moradon. Let's go see him."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "Silan's bones, concentrated with Silan's life force, are harder than steel but most blacksmiths don't touch them as they are hard to melt.  But I discovered a special method to melt Silan bones. I will give you a big reward if you bring me the bones."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "Can you go find me 2 Apples of Moradon to make a special body armor?"

On in_progress
    Say "You're short on Apple of Moradon. This is not enough."

On ready
    Say "All 2 Apples of Moradon have been collected."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Hand me the Apple of Moradon and I'll give you a reward."
